{
  "id": "chimneys___roof_termination",
  "title": "Chimneys - Roof Termination",
  "description": "Chimneys and single wall vents roof termination. Roof terminations for chimneys and single wall vents - no caps.",
  "type": "calculator-chart",
  "components": [
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "content": "## Chimneys and Single Wall Vents Roof Termination\n\nThis tool provides guidance on roof terminations for chimneys and single wall vents without caps.\n\n![chimney termination roof](static/docs/documents/1672/chimney_termination_roof.png \"chimney termination roof\")\n\n### Overview\nProper roof termination is critical for:\n- Preventing water intrusion\n- Ensuring proper draft and ventilation\n- Meeting building code requirements\n- Extending the life of the chimney system"
    },
    {
      "type": "calculator",
      "inputs": [
        {
          "id": "chimney_diameter",
          "label": "Chimney Diameter",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 8
        },
        {
          "id": "roof_pitch",
          "label": "Roof Pitch",
          "type": "select",
          "options": [
            {
              "value": 4,
              "label": "4/12"
            },
            {
              "value": 6,
              "label": "6/12"
            },
            {
              "value": 8,
              "label": "8/12"
            },
            {
              "value": 10,
              "label": "10/12"
            },
            {
              "value": 12,
              "label": "12/12"
            }
          ],
          "defaultValue": 6
        },
        {
          "id": "clearance_requirement",
          "label": "Required Clearance from Roof",
          "type": "number",
          "unit": "inches",
          "defaultValue": 12
        }
      ],
      "outputs": [
        {
          "id": "total_height_above_roof",
          "label": "Total Height Above Roof",
          "formula": "inputs.chimney_diameter / 2 + inputs.clearance_requirement",
          "unit": "inches"
        },
        {
          "id": "flashing_width",
          "label": "Flashing Width Required",
          "formula": "inputs.chimney_diameter + 4",
          "unit": "inches"
        },
        {
          "id": "flashing_length",
          "label": "Flashing Length Required",
          "formula": "(inputs.chimney_diameter + 4) * (inputs.roof_pitch / 12 + 1)",
          "unit": "inches"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}